{"root":"tajam","ipa":"/ta.dʒam/","core":"形容词。指物体边缘或尖端锋利、锐利；也常用于比喻人的头脑敏锐、目光犀利或言辞尖刻。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ta.dʒam/","zh":"锋利的，锐利的","phrases":[{"t":"pisau tajam","zh":"锋利的刀"},{"t":"pikiran tajam","zh":"敏锐的思维"},{"t":"pandangan tajam","zh":"犀利的目光"}],"examples":[{"t":"Hati-hati, pisau itu sangat tajam.","zh":"小心，那把刀非常锋利。"},{"t":"Dia memiliki ingatan yang tajam.","zh":"他拥有敏锐的记忆力。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tajam","ipa":"/ta.dʒam/","zh":"锋利的","phrase":{"t":"tajam sekali","zh":"非常锋利"},"example":{"t":"Ujung pensil ini kurang tajam.","zh":"这支铅笔的笔尖不够尖。"}},{"w":"menajam","ipa":"/mə.na.dʒam/","zh":"变尖，变得尖锐","phrase":{"t":"konflik menajam","zh":"冲突加剧"},"example":{"t":"Persaingan di pasar semakin menajam.","zh":"市场上的竞争正变得日益激烈。"}},{"w":"menajamkan","ipa":"/mə.na.dʒam.kan/","zh":"磨尖，使锋利，使敏锐","phrase":{"t":"menajamkan pisau","zh":"磨刀"},"example":{"t":"Dia menajamkan pensilnya sebelum ujian.","zh":"他在考试前削尖了铅笔。"}},{"w":"ketajaman","ipa":"/kə.ta.dʒa.man/","zh":"锋利度，敏锐度","phrase":{"t":"ketajaman mata","zh":"视力，眼力"},"example":{"t":"Ketajaman penglihatannya mulai berkurang.","zh":"他的视力开始下降。"}}],"derSlugs":["tajam","menajam","menajamkan","ketajaman"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T01:28:49.253Z","src":"base"}